{"title":"2025 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/9/a494dd99c9080fa91537ac2848b4ec2678aba106.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2 \\times 0) + (2 \\times 5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/f/e7fb11a92297615314df3bbf97bf827f1e8a0be8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 0 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 7 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 10 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 12 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"415\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Following <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Order_of_operations\" title=\"Order of operations\">order of operations</a>, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/6590424b80d7754f5209f0e2f41b05a53d00f9f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2 \\times 0) + (2 \\times 5) = 0 + (2 \\times 5) = 0 + 10 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"406\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can notice that this is the same thing as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/e/4eeaba2ee672c03eb89625cc3cacffff29d819f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times (0 + 5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"88\" height=\"20\" /> because we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/e/d2e832cc7e2b4fca54ff94610a78c97cd1d5b266.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 0 + 2 \\times 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/e/7fe40bfe8003b26886e5bb582cd80b8fd254ffc4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times (0 + 5) = 2 \\times 5 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"241\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Pascal&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Pascal (page does not exist)\">2025 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Pascal Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?t